invalid type: string "Cautions\nDo not drive after sedating antihistamines. Avoid alcohol with them.\nSelf-care\nSmall frequent sips of clear fluids, bland dry foods, rest, fresh air.\nSee a doctor if\nNausea beyond 2 days, unable to keep fluids down, severe stomach pain, blood in vomit, or pregnancy\nwith severe vomiting. Also see a doctor if it lasts longer than 2 days.", expected a booleanÿÿÿÿÿ